cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use GrantThai, please cite it as below. GrantThai is a joint work
  with ศูนย์ความรู้พลเมืองปัญญาประดิษฐ์, a centre of ARAYA NIKAH SOCIAL
  ENTERPRISE CO. (อารยานิกะห์ วิสาหกิจเพื่อสังคม). Code is licensed
  Apache-2.0; documentation, specifications and data are licensed CC BY 4.0
  (see REUSE.toml). The author entry below names the founder only, per
  GrantThai's authorship policy (see GOVERNANCE.md).
title: "GrantThai"
abstract: >
  GrantThai: one work object, many routes: one file per chosen route
  (NRIIS_SUBMISSION.md / ACADEMIC_ARTICLE.md / RESEARCH_CONCEPT_NOTE.md);
  unofficial. It is open research infrastructure that helps a person turn a
  real problem into one work object, checks it against GrantThai's own
  rules (validators/rules.yaml), and renders one copy/paste-ready draft file
  for each route the researcher chooses. It is not affiliated with NRCT,
  TSRI, any PMU, NRIIS, or any journal.
authors:
  - family-names: "Lahtee"
    given-names: "Yaoharee"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-3861-0626"
    affiliation: "ARAYA NIKAH SOCIAL ENTERPRISE CO."
license:
